# Core Agent Guardrails

Always read and follow `AGENTS.md` before performing any tasks in this repository.

## Strict Rules:
1. **STOP / СТОП Change Execution Freeze**:
   NEVER implement, modify, or run tasks for any OpenSpec change that contains `STOP` or `СТОП` (case-insensitive) in its folder name, `proposal.md`, or `tasks.md`. Coordinators and workers MUST skip these changes unconditionally.
